.TH sam-jail-run 1 2026-11-25 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-run \- Run an app in its sandbox
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail run\fR [\fB\-\-start\-anyway\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIAPP\fR> [\fIARGS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run an app in its sandbox
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-start\-anyway\fR
Start it even when a protection its settings ask for cannot be set up this time (SAM\*(Aqs helper missing, the Wayland security context refused); without it, such a start is refused. Only for this start
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

.TP
[\fIARGS\fR]

